label a10_cou1_08:

    scene bg02bg with Dissolve(0.5)
    pause 1.5

    "As soon as they got into the room, they threw their bags down."

    show fumi 2 lg casual b at pos_l
    show hina 2 lg casual a at pos_r
    with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1288"
    hina "\"I wanted to hug you so bad!\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual i with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1033"
    fumi "\"Me too!\""

    play music bgm02 fadein 1.0

    "They shared an uncharacteristically passionate embrace. They'd been bursting with affection ever since the bus ride, after all."

    "The shop had closed early, so they had some time before Rin and Miyako got home."

    show hina:
        "hina 2 lg casual g" with Dissolve(0.25)
        ShakeTameiki

    voice "2HI_1289"
    hina "\"Haahh...\""

    show hina 2 lg casual g:
        xoffset 0 yoffset 0
    with None

    "Hina buried her face in Fumi's chest and sighed deeply."

    show fumi 2 lg casual g with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1034"
    fumi "\"You're probably tired, right? Want to skip it for today?\""

    show hina 2 lg casual d with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1290"
    hina "\"No way!\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual i with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1035"
    fumi "\"Pfft.\""

    "She snorted at Hina's immediate response."

    show hina 2 lg casual c with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1291"
    hina "\"It's so nice being with you, Fumi~\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual c with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1036"
    fumi "\"Heh, I feel relaxed when I'm with you too, Hina.\""

    show hina 2 lg casual a with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1292"
    hina "\"It's like I can just be who I am with you.\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual g with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1037"
    fumi "\"Who you are?\""

    show hina 2 lg casual h with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1293"
    hina "\"Yeah. It might have kind of been bothering me how I'm not very girly.\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual d with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1038"
    fumi "\"That's not true! You're really girly.\""

    show hina 2 lg casual f with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1294"
    hina "\"Well, I don't make sweets or dress nice. And I'm always running around, right?\""

    show fumi 1 lg casual i with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1039"
    fumi "\"None of that has anything to do with being a girl.\""

    show hina 2 lg casual a with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1295"
    hina "\"Thanks. You always treat me like a girl, Fumi.\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual f with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1040"
    fumi "\"Of course I do. You're cute, Hina! I'll be sure to remind you of that in the future.\""

    show hina 2 lg casual b with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1296"
    hina "\"Eheh. It's kind of embarrassing.\""

    "Hina ran her hands through her hair awkwardly."

    show hina 2 lg casual a with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1297"
    hina "\"But I've started to think differently about what it means to be a girl since I started dating you, Fumi.\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual g with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1041"
    fumi "\"You have?\""

    show hina 2 lg casual c with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1298"
    hina "\"You were always the ideal girl to me.\""

    show fumi 1 lg casual d with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1042"
    fumi "\"Wow. Now I'm getting embarrassed.\""

    show hina 1 lg casual n with Dissolve(0.25)
    show hina:
        ShakeTameiki

    voice "2HI_1299"
    hina "\"So I always thought I had to try to be like you, but it never really went well.\""

    show hina:
        xoffset 0 yoffset 0
    with None
    show fumi 1 lg casual i with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1043"
    fumi "\"But I always wanted to be like you—\""

    show hina 1 lg casual b with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1300"
    hina "\"Right. You kept saying that. So it kind of dawned on me that maybe 'girly' just means 'like yourself.'\""

    show hina 2 lg casual a with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1301"
    hina "\"Everyone has different ideas of what 'girly' is. Like you and me.\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual b with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1044"
    fumi "\"Yep. Also, there might be a more general, universal idea of 'girliness.'\""

    "Like liking pink. Though there are plenty of girls who do and plenty who don't."

    show hina 2 lg casual d with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1302"
    hina "\"You end up having other people decide for you whether you fit what their idea is, and you compare yourself to others and agonize about it.\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual h with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1045"
    fumi "\"I understand. You feel uneasy sometimes, wondering if who you are now is something you really decided for yourself.\""

    "I'm sure that's true for everyone, not just you two."

    show hina 2 lg casual a with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1303"
    hina "\"But there really isn't a kind of girly that you have to be. All there is is the kind of girl you {i}want{/i} to be.\""

    show hina 2 lg casual c with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1304"
    hina "\"But also, you don't have to push yourself to be who you want to be. Since there are people who will love you anyway.\""

    show fumi:
        "fumi 2 lg casual b" with Dissolve(0.25)
        ShakeYes

    "Fumi nodded."

    show fumi 2 lg casual b:
        xoffset 0 yoffset 0
    with None
    show hina 2 lg casual g with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1305"
    hina "\"All I'm really saying is that I started being able to love myself because you always say such nice things about me.\""

    "Hina seemed a little embarrassed after all that."

    show fumi 1 lg casual a with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1046"
    fumi "\"You're amazing, Hina. You've really been thinking about this, huh?\""

    show hina 2 lg casual d with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1306"
    hina "\"No, it was you who made me feel that way. I wouldn't have been able to find myself if I hadn't fallen in love with you.\""

    voice "2HI_1307"
    hina "\"I want to keep changing. But only for you, Fumi.\""

    show fumi 1 lg casual b with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1047"
    fumi "\"I want to change for you, too. I think if we do, we'll end up being more like who we really are.\""

    show hina 1 lg casual a with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1308"
    hina "\"Yeah, yeah. What we're like is something we get to decide for ourselves, and we don't need to worry about how other people feel about us.\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual i with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2FU_1048"
    fumi "\"I'm glad I met you, Hina. And that will be my conclusion!\""

    show hina 1 lg casual c with dict_dissolve_25

    voice "2HI_1309"
    hina "\"I am, too!\""

    show fumi 2 lg casual c
    show hina 2 lg casual c
    with Dissolve(0.25)

    $ voice2("hina","2HI_1310","fumi","2FU_1049")
    hina_fumi "\"It has to be you, Fumi.\"\n\"It has to be you, Hina.\"" (what_rest_indent=0)

    stop music fadeout 1.0
    stop sound fadeout 1.0
    scene black with Dissolve(0.5)
    pause 3.5

    if persistent.dpatch:
        jump rp_c_scene02
    else:
        "........."
        "......"
        window hide
        pause 2.5
        window auto

